  "mathematical_and_API_review": [
    "FiniteBin preserves actual target-deleted Fin4 source, natural reciprocal owner, every occupied r, the odd-prime floor3, main2a/r^2 and one6K/logN error per occupied r. The same K is chosen before all policy/source parameters; original log-scale and endpoint hypotheses are retained.",
    "Scoped binLo/Hi are exactly the existing three omega-to19/96 prefix factors and terminal a/(r+1) to a/r+a/(r(r+1)) factor. Explicit FQNs in the later proof refer to those same functions; no alternate box/source is introduced.",
    "FifthLower preserves independent old/new strict own-cube indicators, arbitrary positive Fin5 coordinates, old<=new, u-gap, t4<=u/3 and exact12/(t0*t1*t2*t3*u^2). Fin.last4 and literal4 denote the same Fin5 slot; prod_univ_five expands the original product without changing factors.",
    "The two lintegral change statements only beta-reduce the existing goals and instantiate coefficients c*(1/x) or c*(1/v), using original positivity. Domains remain x,y,z in Ioc omega rho, v in Ioc w rho, w in Ioc0h. The exact h*(log(rho/h)+1) factor, all finite-mass/tendsto conclusions and geometric quantifier order are retained.",
    "UpperTail keeps the same target-deleted actual prime carrier, signed difference and cancellation of its Euler baseline; the absolute constant is fixed before all source parameters. Existing t^13/log budget, exp(-min(...,L)), cutoff<=3 zero branch, Q3/Q4 support and 2C/c^2 coefficient are unchanged.",
    "Explicit add_le_add preserves both additive sides and uses nonnegative B*exp(sqrtK)*exp(-t). Pinned Real.pow_div_factorial_le_exp takes explicit real x from section variables, so c*x is the correct existing argument. Finset.eq_empty_iff_forall_notMem is the current exact lemma spelling."
  ],
